<title>USA: SANTANDER HIRES UTILITIES ANALYST JONATHAN ARNOLD.</title>
<headline>SANTANDER HIRES UTILITIES ANALYST JONATHAN ARNOLD.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment Securities Inc said Tuesday it hired electrical utilitities analyst Jonathan Arnold.</p>
<p>Santander said Arnold, formerly of J.P. Morgan Securities, heads a team of five analysts who cover 17 Latin American utility companies in five countries.</p>
